## Title: ShieldFrames
## Notes: Overshield overlay for Blizzard unit frames.|n|nReplaces the default right-edge glow with a transparent bar that extends left across the health bar, sized to the real overshield amount. Supports player, target, focus, pet, and compact party/raid frames.|n|nParty and raid frames also require Interface > Raid Frames > Display Incoming Heals.|nType /shieldframes or /sf for settings. Type /sfdebug for debug info.
